when-fires: an unknown context-dimension token appears on a `tolerates:` vouch. oracle/entry.rs collect_tolerance. `{expected}` = the known-dimension list.
why: 27C §2: the mark vouches nothing and the site stays walled on that dimension (engine-owned closed vocabulary).
